I would also like to see shops that "refilled" themselves, at least with minor
items.  For example, if you bought everything from a shop, it shouldn't render it
totally useless.  It would be cool if you could go back to the Delicatessen in
the mines and get more food.  Assume that other characters bring it in or
something.  This would be especially useful on the lower levels, where if a
character isn't lucky enough, they are dead.


